{"synopsis":"Sebelum akhirnya dibunuh, Hakim Lee, seorang hakim yang percaya bahwa keadilan dapat direalisasikan di ruang pengadilan, melawan perintah sang atasan dan malah memvonis seorang konglomerat dengan hukuman penjara.\nNamun, apakah itu karena ucapan yang pernah dia dengar dulu saat masih kecil? Dengan seluruh ingatannya, Lee mendapatkan kehidupan kedua. Lee Han Young, yang hanya ada keadilan di matanya, dunia membutuhkannya.","alternative_title":"판사 이한영, Судья Ли Хан Ён, Pansa Lee Han-Yeong","author":"Moon Sung Ho, iHaeNal (이해날)","artist":"Jeondoldol (전돌돌)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"22ee7468-a552-49a7-93e4-fdb366e8830f","number":"227","chapter":"227","title":"","date":"2026-05-11","released":"2026-05-11"},{"chapter_id":"283e9c14-1397-4f9b-9328-4b27c34c9c27","number":"226","chapter":"226","title":"","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"64154550-4e10-4d03-a709-abebf8e20e2c","number":"225","chapter":"225","title":"","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"87c1d222-7e32-4645-83ec-0649817ea96a","number":"224","chapter":"224","title":"","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"fc485c4b-5f40-426e-832e-ee29e696fb23","number":"223","chapter":"223","title":"","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"6885e248-4753-4b95-99ea-9f3543a68bb2","number":"222","chapter":"222","title":"","date":"2026-05-09","released":"2026-05-09"},{"chapter_id":"b59a41f6-db45-46e0-9d15-26da0f5d2766","number":"221","chapter":"221","title":"","date":"2026-05-08","released":"2026-05-08"},{"chapter_id":"f264c847-d557-4a18-9ec4-79890047d5c7","number":"220","chapter":"220","title":"","date":"2026-05-08","released":"2026-05-08"},{"chapter_id":"664c0b71-c3e9-48aa-a9d2-235532cf4b67","number":"219","chapter":"219","title":"","date":"2026-05-08","released":"2026-05-08"},{"chapter_id":"dd484f9d-7511-4703-88f6-a31fea3bed13","number":"218","chapter":"218","title":"","date":"2026-05-08","released":"2026-05-08"},{"chapter_id":"